{
  "name": "dsh-llm-openai-completions",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "OpenAI-completions-compatible transport takeover for custom gateways (vLLM / LM Studio / self-hosted proxies): always role:\"system\", enable_thinking / chat_template_kwargs / reasoning_effort driven by the llm-pi-ai model config, a </think> split on the receive side, multimodal true-send (image/audio/video/PDF) with a modality gate, and an llmOpenaiCompletions prompt-source seam — no pi-ai behavior guessing.",
